UID:wtcbd-dang-ky-tham-gia-chuong-trinh-re-designing-growth-2025-tai-wtc-e
 xpo@jtmasia.com
DTSTAMP:20261019T100435Z
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251129
SUMMARY:REGISTER TO JOIN THE RE-DESIGNING GROWTH 2025 PROGRAM AT WTC EXPO
LOCATION:Binh Duong Convention & Exhibition Center (BCEC)\, B11 Hung Vuong
  Street\, Binh Duong Ward\, Ho Chi Minh City\, Vietnam
DESCRIPTION:Dates: 2025-11-28\nHours: 09:00 - 11:00\nVenue: Binh Duong Con
 vention & Exhibition Center (BCEC)\nAddress: B11 Hung Vuong Street\, Binh
  Duong Ward\, Ho Chi Minh City\, Vietnam\nEvent page: https://wtcbinhduon
 g.vn/en/su-kien/register-to-join-the-re-designing-growth-2025-program-at-
 wtc-expo/\nWebsite: https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=9
 Hu3d5IqHECn6rwteN6vZCcm2KyRzMBLq-s1t_PBRt9UNlhYM0FFTVE3MUFLODA4MUxMUFAzNV
 AxVS4u\nStatus: Confirmed\nVietnamese name: ĐĂNG KÝ THAM GIA CHƯƠNG 
 TRÌNH RE-DESIGNING GROWTH 2025 TẠI WTC EXPO\n\nThe program “Re-Desig
 ning Growth – Building Sustainable Business Models for the Future” is
  co-organized by WTC Binh Duong New City (WTC BDNC) in collaboration with
  the Ho Chi Minh City Green Business Association (HGBA)\, the Global Repo
 rting Initiative (GRI)\, and Green Transition Training and Consulting Com
 pany Limited (Green Transition).\n\nThe program aims to support the busin
 ess community on its journey towards green transformation and sustainable
  development by sharing knowledge\, tools\, and practical models.\n\nTime
 : 09:00 – 11:00\, October 29\, 2025 Venue: Conference room Hall A \, A1
 9 Hung Vuong Street\, Binh Duong Ward\, Ho Chi Minh City.\n\nPROGRAM HIGH
 LIGHTS\n\n- Thematic session: “Sustainable Business Model Canvas” –
  re-designing sustainable business growth models.\n- Updates on global ES
 G trends and the latest GRI Standards.\n- Sharing practical insights on s
 ustainability reporting and ESG strategies in Vietnamese enterprises.\n- 
 The signing ceremony of the Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) between WTC
  Binh Duong and GRI marks a significant strategic milestone in enhancing 
 sustainable development capabilities.\n\nEVENT AGENDA\n\nGREEN MESSAGE FR
 OM THE ORGANIZERS\n\nThe Organizer encourages all participants to join ha
 nds in promoting sustainability through small but meaningful actions:\n\n
 - Bring your own reusable water bottle to reduce single-use plastic waste
 .\n- Choose green mobility options such as public transport\, carpooling\
 , cycling\, or other eco-friendly means of travel.\n\nCONTACT INFORMATION
 \n\nMs. Thuy Bo Email: thuy.btt@becamex.com.vn
URL:https://wtcbinhduong.vn/en/su-kien/register-to-join-the-re-designing-g
 rowth-2025-program-at-wtc-expo/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
