UID:wtcbd-hoi-nghi-thuong-dinh-toan-cau-icf-2025-icf-global-summit-2025-de
 n-viet-nam@jtmasia.com
DTSTAMP:20261019T100435Z
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251202
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251204
SUMMARY:ICF GLOBAL SUMMIT 2025 TO BE HOSTED IN VIETNAM
LOCATION:Binh Duong Convention & Exhibition Center (BCEC)\, B11 Hung Vuong
  Street\, Binh Duong Ward\, Ho Chi Minh City\, Vietnam
DESCRIPTION:Dates: 2025-12-02 to 2025-12-03\nVenue: Binh Duong Convention 
 & Exhibition Center (BCEC)\nAddress: B11 Hung Vuong Street\, Binh Duong W
 ard\, Ho Chi Minh City\, Vietnam\nEvent page: https://wtcbinhduong.vn/en/
 su-kien/icf-global-summit-2025-to-be-hosted-in-vietnam/\nWebsite: https:/
 /www.intelligentcommunity.org/\nBrochure: https://wtcbinhduong.vn/wp-cont
 ent/uploads/2025/11/thong-tin-dien-gia-icf-global-summit-2025.pdf\nStatus
 : Confirmed\nVietnamese name: HỘI NGHỊ THƯỢNG ĐỈNH TOÀN CẦU 
 ICF 2025 – ICF GLOBAL SUMMIT 2025 ĐẾN VIỆT NAM\n\nICF GLOBAL SUMMI
 T 2025\n\nThe Intelligent Community Forum (ICF) \, founded in 2002 in New
  York\, is a global network of pioneering cities committed to innovation\
 , sustainable development\, and digital prosperity\, built on a research 
 foundation spanning more than 200 communities across five continents.\n\n
 In 2025\, the ICF Global Summit will be hosted in Binh Duong Ward\, Ho Ch
 i Minh City\, a locality that has firmly established its international st
 anding with five consecutive years in the SMART 21 (2019–2023)\, three 
 consecutive years in the Top 7 Intelligent Communities (2021–2023)\, an
 d the prestigious title of Intelligent Community of the Year 2023\, joini
 ng the ranks of Singapore\, Eindhoven (Netherlands)\, New York (USA)\, Es
 poo (Finland)\, Curitiba (Brazil)\, Winnipeg (Canada)\, and other global 
 leaders.\n\nThe Summit is expected to welcome approximately 600 city lead
 ers\, international experts\, technology corporations\, research institut
 es\, and investors\, serving as a global platform connecting intelligent 
 communities with Vietnamese businesses. It aims to strengthen internation
 al cooperation\, promote Ho Chi Minh City and Vietnam as strategic invest
 ment destinations\, and foster high-level dialogue on sustainable urban d
 evelopment\, technology\, digital transformation\, artificial intelligenc
 e\, and smart governance.\n\nThe Intelligent Community Forum Global Summi
 t 2025 (ICF Global Summit 2025) will take place from December 2–3\, 202
 5 at the Binh Duong Convention & Exhibition Center\, Binh Duong Ward\, Ho
  Chi Minh City\, Vietnam.
URL:https://wtcbinhduong.vn/en/su-kien/icf-global-summit-2025-to-be-hosted
 -in-vietnam/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
