 WTC EXPO International Exhibition Center\nAddress: A19 Hung Vuong Street\
 , Binh Duong Ward\, Ho Chi Minh City\, Vietnam\nEvent page: https://wtcbi
 nhduong.vn/en/su-kien/ho-chi-minh-city-tourism-week-2025/\nStatus: Confir
 med\nVietnamese name: TUẦN LỄ DU LỊCH THÀNH PHỐ HỒ CHÍ MINH 2
 025\n\nThe “Ho Chi Minh City Tourism Week 2025” is organized with the
  aim of promoting the city’s image—expanding beyond its role as a vib
 rant economic and cultural hub to become an attractive and experience-ric
 h tourism destination. The event also serves as a platform to connect pro
 ducers\, service providers\, and consumers\, while showcasing and promoti
 ng local products\, services\, and cuisine. In particular\, activities in
  Binh Duong Ward are highlighted to foster community cultural engagement 
 and development.\n\nKEY ACTIVITIES\n\nEVENT DETAILS\n\n- Time: 09:00 AM 
 – 09:00 PM | December 3 – 7\, 2025.\n- Venue: Hall B – WTC EXPO.\n-
  Address: A19 Hung Vuong Street\, Binh Duong Ward\, Ho Chi Minh City\, Vi
 etnam.
