 with key infrastructure such as the metro system\, Long Thanh Internation
 al Airport\, and Eco-Industrial Parks (EIPs)\, forming a strong foundatio
 n for sustainable development\, attracting high-quality investment\, and 
 enabling deeper participation in global value chains.\n\nSIGNIFICANCE OF 
 THE ANNOUNCEMENT CEREMONY\n\nThe Announcement Ceremony represents an impo
 rtant milestone\, demonstrating Ho Chi Minh City’s strong commitment to
