 T VIỆT NAM NĂM 2026\n\nBRAND STORY\n\nVIFA EXPO – Vietnam Internatio
 nal Furniture & Home Accessories Fair is the pioneering and longest-stand
 ing specialized furniture trade fair brand in Vietnam\, operating since 2
 008. Building upon the successful foundation of its 16 previous editions\
 , the 17th VIFA EXPO continues to assert its brand position while signifi
 cantly expanding its scale\, becoming the largest furniture event in Viet
 nam in 2026.\n\nWith substantial investment in scale and service quality\
 , VIFA EXPO 2026 is poised to be a crucial trade promotion destination in
  the region\, actively boosting export activities and solidifying the pos
 ition of Vietnamese furniture and home décor businesses on the internati
 onal map.\n\nAWARDS AND RECOGNITION\n\na. Title: VIFA EXPO: The annual ol
 d established & largest International Furniture & Home Accessories Fair B
 rand in Vietnam (since 2008) – Thời gian : 26/08/2025. – Vinh danh 
