 nterprises of Vietnam 2025\n\n- Time: September 13\, 2025\n- Awarded by: 
 The Science Institute for Development of Economic and Cultural Manpower (
 SIDECM) and the Center for Research and Application of Consumer Protectio
 n Technology (CONPROCEN)\n\nTIME & VENUE\n\nThe VIFA EXPO 2026 Fair will 
 be held from March 08 – 11\, 2026\, at two major Exhibition Centers in 
