 alia relationship\, alongside strong shifts in the regional and global ec
 onomy.\n\nThe program will take place from May 19 to May 20\, 2026 at Bin
 h Duong Convention and Exhibition Center\, expected to gather around 1000
  delegates\, including senior leaders\, experts\, industry associations a
 nd leading business communities from both countries. The event serves as 
